{"id":"solamente","lemma":"solamente","pos":"adv","rank":972,"glosses":["only, alone, merely"],"ipa":"/ˌsolaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-solamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Solamente quédate cerca.","en":"Just stay close.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799889","words":[null,{"g":"to be , to end up","l":"quedar"},{"g":"close"}]},{"text":"Tan solamente es demasiado pronto.","en":"It's just too soon.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77377","words":[{"g":"so, as"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"too much"},{"g":"prompt, on time"}]},{"text":"Ella no habla solamente inglés, también habla francés.","en":"She can speak not only English but also French.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/733138","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"speech"},null,{"g":"English"},{"g":"also, too, as well"},{"g":"speech"},{"g":"French"}]},{"text":"¿No podemos solamente ir?","en":"Can't we just go?","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to prune","l":"podar"},null,{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Solamente un hombre sobrevivió.","en":"Only one man survived.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459366","words":[null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"man"},{"g":"to survive","l":"sobrevivir"}]}]}